  "about": "About - MA STUDIO Skip links Skip to primary navigation Skip to content Toggle navigation About Portofolio Modelling Architecture is fascinated by the interplay of different levels of scale and thinking: the scale of the city and that of mankind; thinking in abstraction and thinking in tangibility. The cohesion of these levels is not to be found in one compulsive dogmatic theme, but rather in different concepts and concrete projects. The exploring attitude is not to find definitive answers, but to raise questions in order to continue the reflective and research working method for the future innovations of the common worldwide society. Urban Planning Urban Design Architecture Landscape Design Interior Design Engineering Energy Efficient Energy Auditing Contact Address: RR.\"Sami Frasheri\", Njesia Nr. 13, Kompleksi TID, Tirana, Albania, Kutia postare 1020 T. +355 692098818; E: info@mastudio.al This website uses cookies to improve your web experience. Accept Explore Drag Adding {{itemName}} to cart Added {{itemName}} to cart Loading... &times; .elementor-element-populated\", \"getCssFromTarget\": [\"border-top\", \"border-right\", \"border-bottom\", \"border-left\"], \"applyCssTo\": \"> .lqd-animated-line\" }'>",
